  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Mature, actively maintained libre HIS with 8,637 commits and v5.0.7 released April 2026 — development was incorrectly assumed dead due to a stale GitLab mirror; the canonical repo is on Codeberg. Digital Public Good, GNU Official Package, FSF Award recipient. Production deployments across four continents including AIIMS India, Mahosot Hospital Laos, Cruz Roja Mexicana, and Jamaica Ministry of Health. GPL v3+, 40+ packages covering the full HIS scope. Complements OpenMRS (concept-driven modular EMR) and OpenEMR (US practice management) with a social-medicine-oriented integrated HIS.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-14",
